  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting meaningful participation of civil society in Peace Processes in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to greater and more meaningful participation of civil society actors, with a focus on youth and women, in political and peace processes to end the war in Sudan.

Outcomes:
1.	Youth have increased participation and influence in advocating for peace.
2.	Women have increased participation and influence in advocating for peace.
3.	Grassroots civil society have increased participation and influence in advocating for peace.
4.	Civil society have strengthened capacity to act, participate, and influence. 
5.	Civilian coalitions such as Somoud have strengthened capacity to act, participate, and influence the political process to end the war</narrative>
  </description>
